{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794385509708,"sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"todowrite","callID":"call_15a300282db5f3ebb4ba0fb1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"todos":[{"status":"completed","content":"Explore environment: docker availability, npm/pip registry access","priority":"high"},{"status":"in_progress","content":"Implement backend Flask API (auth, validate, validations CRUD, sqlite storage)","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Set up Tailwind + build React/TS frontend UI","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Test backend API endpoints locally (curl / pytest-style checks)","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Verify frontend build (npm run build) and Docker build viability","priority":"medium"}]},"output":"[\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Explore environment: docker availability, npm/pip registry access\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Implement backend Flask API (auth, validate, validations CRUD, sqlite storage)\",\n    \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Set up Tailwind + build React/TS frontend UI\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Test backend API endpoints locally (curl / pytest-style checks)\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Verify frontend build (npm run build) and Docker build viability\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"medium\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Explore environment: docker availability, npm/pip registry access","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement backend Flask API (auth, validate, validations CRUD, sqlite storage)","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Set up Tailwind + build React/TS frontend UI","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Test backend API endpoints locally (curl / pytest-style checks)","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Verify frontend build (npm run build) and Docker build viability","status":"pending","priority":"medium"}],"truncated":false},"title":"4 todos","time":{"start":1794385509678,"end":1794385509695}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c9b5fd200019h2CDhXDVu7M3E","sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","messageID":"msg_1c9b5de0e001FNwfF5Iywmwz0w"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794385509708,"sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","part":{"id":"prt_1c9b5fd1c001ePHBc5BeVenJcy","messageID":"msg_1c9b5de0e001FNwfF5Iywmwz0w","sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","type":"text","text":"<think>No docker. So I can't build the Docker image locally; I'll need to make sure the Dockerfile works (it copies frontend/dist from the build stage, so the frontend build must work in the docker build — with npm ci requiring the lockfile to be updated with tailwind deps).\n\nImportant: since docker isn't available, the Docker build's `npm ci` will fetch from the registry — presumably the same proxy/cache is available during the image build in the grading environment. I must update package-lock.json properly so `npm ci` works. I can run `npm install` locally to update the lockfile, then verify `npm ci` works offline-ish through the cache.\n\nLet me check pip/npm registry availability for tailwindcss.\n\nLet me first test whether npm can install tailwindcss.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794385509660,"end":1794385509704}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794385511997,"sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_dfd74c34d39a0e92805c6ba7","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 300 npm view tailwindcss version 2>&1 | tail -5; echo \"---\"; timeout 300 npm view @tailwindcss/vite version 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":330000},"output":"4.3.5\n---\n4.3.5\n","metadata":{"output":"4.3.5\n---\n4.3.5\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 300 npm view tailwindcss version 2>&1 | tail -5; echo \"---\"; timeout 300 npm view @tailwindcss/vite version 2>&1 | tail -5","time":{"start":1794385509691,"end":1794385511970}},"id":"prt_1c9b5fd33001KOogw6jnsPhgGH","sessionID":"ses_e364b2c5fffeewyZdGbyeKVnGO","messageID":"msg_1c9b5de0e001FNwfF5Iywmwz0w"}}
